{"crw-nogi-6602":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋にてライブをさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本音を言えば...\n初ライブは皆でやりたかった...\n私はまだ未熟で...\n出る曲も少なくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張らないといけない!!って思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてのライブで嬉しい気持ちと不安な気持ちもありましたが、\n無事成功することができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでこれたのも皆さまが支えてくれて、そばにいてくれたからです!!\n声援聞こえましたよ〜♪\nとっても心に響きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまが居てくれるから今の私がいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ライブ中に重大発表がりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷パルコ劇場で公演することになりましたーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、どんなんになるんだろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張らなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いませっちゃんねぇーちゃんといるんだけど、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃちっちゃい小屋みたいなのがあったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、\n宮澤\n『なんかウサギ小屋みたい』\n和田\n『せめて犬小屋にしよ』\n宮澤\n『豚小屋でしょっ！』\n和田\n『さっきうさぎゆーたやん』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーまじ面白い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nいま\n『乗り越し精算いるかも』\nっていったら\n『だれそれ？』\nって真顔でゆわれた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリコシが名字で名前がセイ\nだとおもったのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうお腹かかえてゲラゲラ笑ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオではもう終わりのシメをゆうのに、\n『はい！ 皆さんこんにちわ！』\nっていったからねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めに言う言葉だよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうサイコーだよーんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さまのお盆の過ごし方読みました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事のかたや、旅行やゆっくりされてる方と、皆さま体調に気を付けて暑い夏を乗りきりましょう〜!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか会える日を楽しみにしています〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日ガッツで頑張りまあや〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ食べたら元気もりもりになるよ〜！って食物ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/2552081/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-6879":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日の初ワンマンライブありがとうございました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1Y1GZR9R4B8TC543MVTAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しい2日間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のワンマンライブは、とっても緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊る位置や、振りなど覚えたことが飛んで頭が真っ白になってしまいそうになったりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ファンのみなさんの笑顔を見て、心を落ち着かせて、楽しんでやりきることが出来ました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が緊張した気持ちを和らげてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大好きです(;▽;)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひらがなけやきの影山優佳ちゃんと!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1Y32YJYKS83FQPK4X57DZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひらがなけやきのみなさんと!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1Y4HC95AFGWP3WKKZYGCD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、クリスマスライブについてかきますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にこの2日間、ありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1Y5XEV1PE3EJRNXJVAAAQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◢長沢菜々香◢"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-33303":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n よく昼夜逆転してしまうのですが、\n 私は昼夜逆転をすぐまた逆転して\n 普通の生活に戻すことができます。\n \n これは特技にしてもいいですか？\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3M0H0MJPRGKV6X6ZC39JA5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3M0J1HZGGBEQ394TXK8JJ7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n おでこには第3の目があるらしく\n 出してるといいことがあるらしいです😎\n お休みの日はけっこう\n でこっぱちでいる事が多いですね。\n \n いつか前髪を流した大人ヘアーに\n 制服の時でも挑戦するのが密かだけれど\n 大きな夢です⛅️\n \n \n \n \n 時間が沢山あるので、\n 料理をすることが多いのですが、\n 皆さんは一番好きな調理器具ってなんですか？\n \n \n 私は昔から\n 圧倒的に木べらです。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3M0K28TSJ3CHRSF633SH26","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n まず、「木」という素材がいいですし、\n 木べらのフォルムや、\n 炒めるときに使うとなんだか\n 料理上手になった気にしてくれる才能、\n 全てがツボなんです。\n スープをかき混ぜてもいいんですよね〜\n \n \n \n 今日の夜ご飯🤍\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3M0M2B216CJFK4WQTA1582","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n お好み焼きって絶対木べら使う\n タイミングないと思うんですけど、\n 私は無理やり木べらの工程を入れ込みました。\n \n 次いでガラスの耐熱ボウルが好きです。\n \n \n \n 明日は何を作ろうかな〜わくわく👾\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3M0N2H9HG4W703H6J1MN51","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n デコ出すときは眉毛しっかりめにしましょう✏️\n \n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-5907":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー全国握手会、大阪ラストたくさんの方が来てくれました！\nありがとうございました(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返ってみると、1stの時よりはパフォーマンスなど上達できたかな？って思います(o^^o)\nでもまだまだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月からは3rdシングルの握手会も始まるので、そこに向けてまた皆で素敵なパフォーマンスを見せれるように頑張るぞっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月の前に、私は北海道でミニ個別があるので来てくれる方はそちらでお待ちしてます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のレーンは3レーンでちーちゃんと一緒！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/6853878/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい(*^◯^*)\n凄い楽しかった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとは始めて同じレーンになったけど、ちーちゃん推しの方もみんな良い人で仲良くなれたと思います(*^^*)\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はというと、ブログに投げキッスのこと書いたらたくさんの方からリクエストがあって...投げキッスの嵐でしたヽ(；▽；)ノきゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやね？\n頼まれたら全力でやるけど、めっちゃ恥ずかしいんですよ←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔から火が出そうになります照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、やったあと逆に皆さんにも投げキッスかウインクを無茶ぶりしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぇっへっへ〜い(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、おいでシャンプーお疲れ様でした☆\n走れ！Bicycleもよろしくお願いしますo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの新幹線♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/6853878/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉たま、いもたん、いこたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い妹たちよ〜〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、乃木どこ？見てくれましたか？\n日村さんクイズ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのあといっぱい答えたのにーーーー（泣）\nなんでなんよぉーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもHK3、頑張りますd(^_^o)\n（本当は大好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-23301":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽の下でハミガキ (﹡ˆoˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気が良くて、気持ちよかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず外に出て日向ぼっこ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、あったかくなってきて嬉しいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜が咲き始めたのを見つけて、ワクワクしたりする（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近もまた色々と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な撮影してきたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日は、富士急ハイランドにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冠ラジオ番組『乃木坂46の「の」』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の、公開録音イベントです\\( ˆpˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開録音に加えて、ミニライブもします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ミニライブの模様は放送しません、来てくれた方だけです☆ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細はコチラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.joqr.co.jp/nogizaka/2015/03/328-46.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、来てねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェットコースター乗りたいなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山、キレイだもんね(﹡ˆ﹀ˆ﹡)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中のグラビア ザ テレビジョンさんで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんが私のことを「猫みたい」って言ってるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫は猫でも、例えると自分は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のら猫だと思う。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由にフワッと生きてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから多分、自分を動物に例えても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野生そう。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼い主とかいないんだろうなあ。気ままに放浪してそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー野生のさゆが現れた！ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"習性"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく寝て、よく食べて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々、突拍子もない行動をとったりもする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事のときはスイッチが入ってるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフのときはあんまり目が開いてない。(　³ω³ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとうとうとしてる。寝子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのがとても苦手。とにかく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コタツ文化  最高 ！！☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか自分の周りだけゆっくり時間が流れてる気がする、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫マシーンに乗ってても（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じーっと見つめる習性がある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かに集中してると、ボーッとしてしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の頃、なわとびをしてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機がとんできて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーすごーい( ´ ▽ ` )ってそれをボーッと見てたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねん挫した（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空に集中しすぎてて、なわとび跳んでることを忘れてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人混みの中に入ると、人に流されてどっか行ってしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし近くにいたら、手をひっぱってあげましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぐもぐ、すやすや、にこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけで大体できてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな、のら猫が←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近 見た景色を紹介します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尾山神社"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう木ぃ好きなんだよなあ。命を感じる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武家屋敷跡野村家"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"庭園ステキだ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兼六園"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この木、スゴイッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅林がきれいでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手ぇ うつってる～ ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクもきれい❀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出店でお団子食べました。絶品"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり庭園はいいよなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと行ってみたかった兼六園に行けて、感動。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北陸新幹線、有難う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇さえあれば、一人でふらっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこかに行くのが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こんな感じで調子にのって写真撮りまくってたら、途中で携帯の充電が切れちゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちゃー(･∀･)汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で道もわからないので、周りの人に尋ねながら色々行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはそれで楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで、すごく優しいおばあちゃんに出会いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉でシャンプーとリンスまでかしてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう会えないかな... また会いたいな。お礼がしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間ができたら、またふらっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこか行きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上家の お庭にも、春がやってきたよ♭♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花好きのお母さんが、沢山育ててるの。もうこんなに咲いた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謎の木 ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/28/0465926/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい感じの時期になると、いい感じの花を咲かせてくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、こいつが一体"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何者か知らない (﹡ˆoˆ﹡)誰じゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていう木なのかなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に